        <p><strong>Important distinction:</strong> Your NIE is NOT the same as your TIE card. The NIE is a tax identification number (just a number: 12345678-Z). The TIE is a physical identity card issued when you're granted residency in Spain. They use the same identification number, but the NIE is the number itself, and the TIE is the card.</p>
